#Patches

A notlob project demonstrating the Rust binding by converting a slice of
the `patches-dsp` audio kernel library into literate form.  Three
modules are included: a denormal-flushing primitive, time-domain
utilities, and a DC-blocking highpass filter that depends on the
denormal primitive — exercising cross-module `#References` resolution
under the Rust binding.

---

#Binding
    ~language rust
    ~property-testing proptest
